# 📊 Full Project Report — `mychitti-main`

> **Generated:** 2 March 2026 | **Platform:** Laravel 10 | **Type:** Multi-Vendor SaaS Marketplace

---

## 1. Project Overview

**mychitti-main** is a large-scale, multi-vendor SaaS marketplace platform built on **Laravel 10**. It supports multiple business verticals (food delivery, grocery, pharmacy, parcel, eCommerce, services) all within a single codebase, distinguished by a **zone + module** architecture. It includes portals for Admins, Vendors/Stores, Delivery Men, and Customers, exposed via both a web panel and a REST API layer.

---

## 2. Technology Stack

| Layer | Technology |
|---|---|
| **Backend Framework** | Laravel 10 (PHP ^7.3 / ^8.1) |
| **Database** | MySQL (via Eloquent ORM + Spatial support) |
| **Authentication** | Laravel Passport (OAuth2), Firebase JWT |
| **Real-time** | Laravel WebSockets (Pusher-compatible), Pusher PHP Server |
| **File Storage** | Local disk, AWS S3 (Flysystem v3), Cloudflare R2 |
| **Task Queue** | Sync (configurable) / Laravel Queues |
| **Email** | SMTP via Laravel Mail + 30+ email templates |
| **Package Manager** | Composer (PHP), npm (JS/CSS assets) |
| **Bundler** | Laravel Mix (webpack.mix.js) |
| **Geospatial** | `matanyadaev/laravel-eloquent-spatial` |
| **PDF Generation** | mPDF |
| **Excel Import/Export** | Maatwebsite Excel, Rap2hpoutre Fast Excel |
| **Image Processing** | Intervention Image |
| **CAPTCHA** | Gregwar CAPTCHA |
| **Module System** | nwidart/laravel-modules |

---

## 3. Architecture

### 3.1 Folder Structure

```
mychitti-main/
├── app/
│   ├── AI/                  # AI agents & factory
│   ├── CentralLogics/       # Core business logic helpers (13 files)
│   ├── Console/             # Scheduled commands & artisan commands
│   ├── Contracts/           # 26 interfaces/contracts
│   ├── DTOs/                # Data Transfer Objects
│   ├── Enums/               # 26 enum definitions
│   ├── Events/              # Event classes
│   ├── Exports/             # 82 Excel export classes
│   ├── Http/
│   │   ├── Controllers/     # 262 controllers
│   │   │   ├── Admin/       # 88 admin panel controllers
│   │   │   ├── Vendor/      # 78 vendor panel controllers
│   │   │   ├── Api/         # 52 REST API controllers
│   │   │   └── Front/       # 13 public web controllers
│   │   ├── Middleware/      # 35 middleware
│   │   └── Requests/        # 37 form request validators
│   ├── Imports/             # 11 Excel import classes
│   ├── Jobs/                # 7 queue jobs
│   ├── Library/             # Constants, helpers, responses (9 files)
│   ├── Mail/                # 30 mailable classes
│   ├── Models/              # 250+ Eloquent models
│   ├── Repositories/        # 23 repository classes
│   ├── Services/            # 20 service classes (including AI)
│   ├── Traits/              # 10 reusable traits
│   └── Utils/               # Language, settings, constants utilities
├── database/
│   ├── migrations/          # 131 migration files (2022–2026)
│   ├── seeders/             # 10 seeders
│   └── factories/           # 8 factories
├── routes/
│   ├── admin.php            # Admin panel routes (~89 KB)
│   ├── vendor.php           # Vendor panel routes (~107 KB)
│   ├── vendor_employee.php  # Vendor employee routes (~107 KB)
│   ├── web.php              # Public web routes (~28 KB)
│   └── api/                 # REST API routes (split files)
├── resources/               # Views, JS, CSS (1182 files)
├── public/                  # Static assets (2491 files)
├── Modules/                 # nwidart modular features
└── config/                  # 28 config files
```

