## 4. Core Features

### 4.1 Order & Delivery Management
- Full order lifecycle: placement → acceptance → preparation → delivery → completion
- Order types: standard, parcel, prescription/pharmacy, POS, guest orders
- Delivery man assignment, tracking, history, and vehicle management (`DMVehicle`)
- Order refund system with configurable refund reasons
- Partial payment support, service charge, tips, cutlery options
- Real-time order delivery history tracking

### 4.2 Store / Vendor Management
- Multi-store, multi-zone setup
- Store scheduling, shifts, holidays, holiday overrides
- Store galleries, documents, signatures, announcements
- Vendor subscriptions & subscription plan requests
- Store wallets, daily balance, bank accounts & transactions
- Vendor ledger entries, store accounts, disbursements
- Store teams and team members

### 4.3 Product / Menu Item Management
- Hierarchical categories with slugs, SEO, banners
- Items with variations, add-ons, attributes, tags, FAQs, area keywords
- Flash sales and item campaigns
- Pharmacy-specific item details
- Bulk item import/export (Excel)
- Temp product staging system

### 4.4 Customer Management
- User registration, social login (`laravel/socialite`), phone verification
- Customer wallet, loyalty points, referral code system
- Wishlists, cart management (database-persisted), recent searches
- Customer addresses with geospatial support
- Guest checkout support

### 4.5 Marketing & Promotions
- Coupon system (admin + vendor created)
- Flash sales (global & store-level)
- Item campaigns, campaign stores
- Wallet bonuses (configurable rules)
- Offer banners, module-wise banners
- Admin promotional banners, testimonials, admin features/criteria

### 4.6 Reporting & Analytics
- Large `ReportController.php` (~188 KB) covering:
  - Revenue reports, order reports, expense reports
  - Delivery man reports, disbursement reports
  - Loyalty point reports, wallet reports
  - Sales statistics, store-wise analytics
- DashboardController with comprehensive KPI aggregation (~74 KB)
- Excel export for most report types

### 4.7 Zone & Module System
- Geographic zones with polygon-based boundaries
- Module types (food, grocery, pharmacy, parcel, eCommerce, shops)
- Module-zone assignments, zone-based payment method toggles
- Maximum COD order amount per zone
- Module-wise banners, why-choose sections

### 4.8 POS (Point of Sale)
- `POSController.php` (~38 KB) for in-store orders
- POS tokens and POS token items
- Integrated with the order pipeline

### 4.9 Inventory Management
- Inventory items, orders, order details, gate passes
- Branch inventory, inventory reports, supply orders
- Storage units, purchase orders, return purchase slips

### 4.10 HR / Employee Management
- Attendance tracking, time cards
- Salary management, leave management
- Employee roles, temporary employees
- Advance requests, gate passes (employee)
- Holiday management, department management

### 4.11 Accounting & Finance
- Ledger accounts and account types
- Accounts, account transactions, account detail options
- Day books, cash books, expenses
- Manual invoices, invoice items, invoice configuration
- Receivable receipts, disbursements, withdrawal methods

### 4.12 Lead & Service Management
- `LeadOrder`, `LeadOrderDetail`, `LeadStatus`, `LeadsDistribution`
- Service requests, service invoices, accepted service requests
- Quotations, quotation details, service coupons
- Service notifications, service reports
- Common service issues, in-service quotations

### 4.13 Conversations & Messaging
- Real-time chat via WebSockets
- Conversations between users and vendors
- Message model with file support
- `ConversationController` in admin panel

### 4.14 Website / CMS Settings
- `BusinessSettingsController.php` (~330 KB) — master settings controller
- Blog system (BlogCategory, BlogPost)
- SEO content, social media links, newsletter
- Contact forms, react/flutter special criteria
- `claudeai_webpage_settings/` — UI config for Claude AI landing pages
- `sitemap.xml` (42 KB)

### 4.15 Notification System
- Database notifications (UserNotification, InAppNotification, ServiceNotification)
- Push notifications via Firebase (`firebase-messaging-sw.js`, `service-account-key.json`)
- Notification messages and templates

### 4.16 Multi-language Support
- `LanguageController`, `Translation` model
- `app/Utils/language.php` utilities
- `current_language_key` stored per user

