## 5. AI & Intelligent Features

### 5.1 AI Chat System
- `AIChatMessage` model (messages stored per admin, with summarization flag)
- `Summary` model (rolling message summaries for memory efficiency)
- `AdminMemory` model (persistent key-value memory per admin)
- `AIChatController` in the admin panel

### 5.2 AI Services
| Service | File | Description |
|---|---|---|
| `ClaudeService` | `Services/ClaudeService.php` | Anthropic Claude API integration (8 KB) |
| `OpenAIService` | `Services/OpenAIService.php` | OpenAI API integration (7.7 KB) |
| `AiServiceClient` | `Services/AiServiceClient.php` | Generic AI client abstraction (5.6 KB) |
| `MemoryService` | `Services/MemoryService.php` | Context memory management (7.6 KB) |

### 5.3 Agent System
- `AgentFactory`, `AgentTask`, `AgentFunction`, `AgentRunLog`, `AgentVersion`, `AgentApiTool` models
- `AIAgentSkillController.php` in Admin (~12 KB)
- Agent Tasks, Function Registration, Run Logging

### 5.4 System Prompts
- `SystemPrompt` model (3.2 KB)
- `SystemPromptController.php` for managing admin-side AI system prompts
- `AiProvider` model for multi-provider support

